# ---- Submissions ----
# Excluded wholesale (567 MB of probe outputs). Only the TWO selected finals
# are force-added. Every other submission this repository documents is
# regenerable byte-exactly by the reproduce_*.py scripts, so a reviewer can
# rebuild any of them and check the documented SHA-256 without us shipping
# hundreds of megabytes of intermediate CSV.
submissions/*
!submissions/147_private_safe_nonnegative_current_l001.csv
!submissions/200_shape_anchor_l003.csv
